 * On top of this improved base algorithm, we apply Exo scheduling:
 *   - We tile the reduction over k with a tunable constant TILE_K to improve
 *     locality for large m and to give the compiler a better vectorization target.
 *   - We parallelize the outer i-loop with OpenMP via parallelize_loop, since
 *     rows of the (lower-triangular) output C are independent.
